{"n":9,"title":"Logistic regression, predicting yes or no","part":"C","partName":"Classification","words":1114,"minutes":6,"sections":[{"id":"h-91-why-not-a-straight-line","title":"9.1 Why not a straight line?"},{"id":"h-92-the-sigmoid","title":"9.2 The sigmoid"},{"id":"h-93-the-decision-boundary","title":"9.3 The decision boundary"},{"id":"h-94-odds-and-log-odds","title":"9.4 Odds and log-odds"},{"id":"h-95-the-threshold-is-a-choice","title":"9.5 The threshold is a choice"},{"id":"h-96-more-than-two-classes","title":"9.6 More than two classes"}],"speechHash":"28a19686","fa":{"total":38,"translated":38},"html":"<p><strong><span data-s=\"0\" data-w=\"0\">Purpose.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"0\">Many</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"1\">business</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"2\">questions</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"3\">have</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"5\">yes</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"6\">or</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"7\">no</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"8\">answer:</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"9\">will</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"10\">this</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"11\">customer</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"12\">repay,</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"13\">accept</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"15\">offer,</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"16\">churn?</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"0\">Logistic</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"1\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"4\">standard</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"5\">first</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"6\">model</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"7\">for</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"8\">them.</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"2\">easy</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"4\">explain,</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"5\">hard</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"7\">beat</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"8\">as</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"10\">baseline,</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"12\">it</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"13\">is</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"14\">also</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"16\">building</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"17\">block</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"18\">of</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"19\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"20\">networks.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>هدف.</strong> خیلی از سؤال‌های کسب‌وکار جواب بله یا خیر دارند: آیا این مشتری پس می‌دهد، پیشنهاد را می‌پذیرد، ترک می‌کند؟ رگرسیون لجستیک مدل اول استاندارد برای آن‌هاست. توضیح دادنش آسان است، به‌عنوان مدل پایه سخت شکست می‌خورد، و بلوک سازنده‌ی شبکه‌های عصبی هم هست.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"0\">Key</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"1\">ideas</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>ایده‌های کلیدی</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"0\">Despite</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"1\">its</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"2\">name,</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"3\">logistic</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"4\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"6\">a</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"7\">classification</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"8\">model.</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"1\">outputs</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"3\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"4\">between</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"5\">0</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"7\">1.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">با وجود اسمش، رگرسیون لجستیک یک مدل دسته‌بندی است. یک احتمال بین 0 و 1 خروجی می‌دهد.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"1\">takes</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"3\">same</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"4\">weighted</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"5\">sum</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"6\">as</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"7\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"8\">regression,</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"9\">z</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"10\">=</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"11\">w</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"12\">.</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"13\">x</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"14\">+</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"15\">b,</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"16\">and</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"17\">squeezes</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"18\">it</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"19\">through</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"20\">the</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"21\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"22\">function.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">همان مجموع وزنی رگرسیون خطی را می‌گیرد، <code>z = w . x + b</code>، و آن را از تابع سیگموید (sigmoid) رد می‌کند.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"1\">decision</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"2\">boundary</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"4\">where</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"5\">z</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"6\">=</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"7\">0,</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"8\">which</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"9\">is</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"10\">where</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"11\">the</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"12\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"13\">is</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"14\">0.5.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مرز تصمیم جایی است که <code>z = 0</code> است، یعنی جایی که احتمال 0.5 است.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"1\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"2\">cut-off</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"5\">choice,</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"6\">not</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"7\">a</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"8\">law.</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"1\">can</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"2\">move</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"3\">it.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">آستانه‌ی 0.5 یک انتخاب است، نه قانون. می‌توانی جابه‌جایش کنی.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"h-91-why-not-a-straight-line\"><span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"0\">9.1</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"1\">Why</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"2\">not</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"4\">straight</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"5\">line?</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">9.1 چرا یک خط راست نه؟</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"0\">Ng's</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"1\">example</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"4\">tumour</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"5\">that</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"6\">is</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"7\">benign</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"8\">(0)</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"9\">or</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"10\">malignant</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"11\">(1),</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"12\">predicted</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"13\">from</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"14\">its</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"15\">size.</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"1\">could</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"2\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"4\">straight</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"5\">line</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"7\">those</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"8\">0s</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"9\">and</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"10\">1s</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"12\">call</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"13\">anything</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"14\">above</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"15\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"16\">malignant.</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"1\">works</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"2\">on</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"3\">tidy</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"4\">data,</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"5\">but</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"6\">it</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"7\">breaks</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"8\">for</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"9\">two</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"10\">reasons</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"11\">(Ng,</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"12\">video</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"13\">31):</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مثال Ng یک تومور است که خوش‌خیم (0) یا بدخیم (1) است و از روی اندازه‌اش پیش‌بینی می‌شود. می‌توانی یک خط راست به آن 0 و 1ها برازش کنی و هر چیز بالای 0.5 را بدخیم بنامی. روی داده‌ی مرتب کار می‌کند، ولی به دو دلیل خراب می‌شود (Ng، ویدیوی 31):</div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"0\">Add</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"1\">one</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"2\">very</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"3\">large</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"4\">tumour</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"5\">far</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"8\">right.</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"1\">line</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"2\">tilts</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"4\">chase</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"5\">it,</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"7\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"8\">crossing</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"9\">moves,</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"11\">some</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"12\">tumours</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"13\">that</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"14\">were</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"15\">classified</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"16\">correctly</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"17\">are</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"18\">now</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"19\">wrong.</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"0\">One</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"1\">outlier</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"2\">should</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"3\">not</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"4\">rewrite</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"5\">your</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"6\">rule.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یک تومور خیلی بزرگ را دور در سمت راست اضافه کن. خط کج می‌شود تا دنبالش برود، نقطه‌ی عبور از 0.5 جابه‌جا می‌شود، و بعضی تومورهایی که درست دسته‌بندی شده بودند حالا غلط‌اند. یک داده‌ی پرت نباید قانون تو را بازنویسی کند.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"1\">line</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"2\">produces</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"3\">numbers</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"4\">like</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"5\">-0.4</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"7\">1.7.</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"0\">They</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"1\">are</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"2\">not</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"3\">probabilities</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"5\">mean</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"6\">nothing.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">خط عددهایی مثل 0.4- و 1.7 تولید می‌کند. این‌ها احتمال نیستند و معنایی ندارند.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"0\">We</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"1\">need</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"3\">curve</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"4\">that</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"5\">stays</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"6\">between</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"7\">0</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"9\">1</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"11\">flattens</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"12\">at</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"13\">both</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"14\">ends.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">به منحنی‌ای نیاز داریم که بین 0 و 1 بماند و در دو سر صاف شود.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-92-the-sigmoid\"><span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"0\">9.2</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"1\">The</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"2\">sigmoid</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">9.2 سیگموید</div>\n<div class=\"math\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(z) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-z}} \\qquad f_{\\vec{w},b}(\\vec{x}) = g(\\vec{w} \\cdot \\vec{x} + b)</annotation></semantics></math></span></div>\n<p><img src=\"assets/notes/sigmoid.png\" alt=\"The sigmoid curve, with the point where the probability is 0.5\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p><span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"0\">For</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"2\">very</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"3\">large</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"4\">z</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"6\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"8\">close</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"9\">to</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"10\">1.</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"0\">For</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"2\">very</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"3\">large</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"4\">negative</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"5\">z</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"6\">it</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"8\">close</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"9\">to</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"10\">0.</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"0\">At</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"1\">z</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"2\">=</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"3\">0</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"4\">it</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"6\">exactly</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"7\">0.5.</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"0\">Some</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"1\">values:</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"2\">g(-3)</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"3\">=</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"4\">0.047,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"5\">g(-1)</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"6\">=</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"7\">0.269,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"8\">g(0)</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"9\">=</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"10\">0.5,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"11\">g(1)</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"12\">=</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"13\">0.731,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"14\">g(3)</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"15\">=</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"16\">0.953.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">برای <code>z</code> خیلی بزرگ سیگموید نزدیک 1 است. برای <code>z</code> خیلی منفی نزدیک 0 است. در <code>z = 0</code> دقیقاً 0.5 است. چند مقدار: <code>g(-3) = 0.047</code> و <code>g(-1) = 0.269</code> و <code>g(0) = 0.5</code> و <code>g(1) = 0.731</code> و <code>g(3) = 0.953</code>.</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"0\">Read</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"2\">model's</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"3\">output</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"4\">as</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"6\">probability:</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"7\">if</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"8\">f(x)</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"9\">=</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"10\">0.7,</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"11\">the</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"12\">model</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"13\">says</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"14\">there</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"15\">is</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"17\">70%</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"18\">chance</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"19\">that</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"20\">y</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"21\">=</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"22\">1</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"23\">for</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"24\">this</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"25\">input</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"26\">(and</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"27\">so</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"28\">a</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"29\">30%</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"30\">chance</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"31\">that</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"32\">y</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"33\">=</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"34\">0).</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">خروجی مدل را به‌عنوان احتمال بخوان: اگر <code>f(x) = 0.7</code> باشد، مدل می‌گوید برای این ورودی 70٪ شانس هست که <code>y = 1</code> باشد (و پس 30٪ شانس که <code>y = 0</code>).</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-93-the-decision-boundary\"><span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"0\">9.3</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"1\">The</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"2\">decision</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"3\">boundary</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">9.3 مرز تصمیم</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"0\">To</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"1\">turn</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"3\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"4\">into</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"6\">yes</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"7\">or</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"8\">no,</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"9\">use</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"11\">threshold,</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"12\">usually</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"13\">0.5.</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"1\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"3\">at</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"4\">least</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"5\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"6\">exactly</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"7\">when</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"8\">z</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"9\">is</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"10\">at</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"11\">least</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"12\">0,</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"13\">so</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"15\">model</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"16\">predicts</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"17\">1</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"18\">when</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"19\">w</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"20\">.</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"21\">x</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"22\">+</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"23\">b</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"24\">is</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"25\">at</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"26\">least</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"27\">0.</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"1\">set</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"3\">inputs</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"4\">where</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"5\">w</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"6\">.</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"7\">x</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"8\">+</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"9\">b</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"10\">=</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"11\">0</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"12\">is</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <strong><span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"14\">decision</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"15\">boundary</span></strong><span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"15\">:</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"17\">line</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"18\">when</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"19\">there</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"20\">are</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"21\">two</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"22\">features.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">برای تبدیل احتمال به بله یا خیر از یک آستانه استفاده کن، معمولاً 0.5. سیگموید دقیقاً وقتی حداقل 0.5 است که <code>z</code> حداقل 0 باشد، پس مدل وقتی <code>w . x + b</code> حداقل 0 باشد 1 را پیش‌بینی می‌کند. مجموعه‌ی ورودی‌هایی که <code>w . x + b = 0</code> است <strong>مرز تصمیم</strong> است: وقتی دو ویژگی هست یک خط.</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"0\">Take</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"1\">w</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"2\">=</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"3\">[1,</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"4\">1]</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"6\">b</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"7\">=</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"8\">-3.</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"1\">boundary</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"3\">x1</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"4\">+</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"5\">x2</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"6\">=</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"7\">3.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><code>w = [1, 1]</code> و <code>b = -3</code> را بگیر. مرز <code>x1 + x2 = 3</code> است.</div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Input x</th>\n<th>z = x1 + x2 - 3</th>\n<th>Probability</th>\n<th>Prediction</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>[1, 1]</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>0.269</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[2, 2]</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.731</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[3, 0]</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>on the boundary</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"0\">Straight</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"1\">boundaries</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"2\">are</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"3\">not</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"5\">limit.</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"0\">If</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"1\">you</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"2\">feed</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"4\">model</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"5\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"6\">features,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"7\">such</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"8\">as</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"9\">x1</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"10\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"12\">x2</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"13\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"14\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"15\">8),</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"16\">then</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"17\">with</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"18\">weights</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"19\">1</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"20\">and</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"21\">1</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"22\">and</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"23\">b</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"24\">=</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"25\">-1</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"26\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"27\">boundary</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"28\">x1</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"29\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"30\">+</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"31\">x2</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"32\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"33\">=</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"34\">1</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"35\">is</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"36\">a</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"37\">circle:</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"38\">points</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"39\">inside</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"40\">are</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"41\">class</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"42\">0,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"43\">points</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"44\">outside</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"45\">class</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"46\">1.</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"1\">model</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"3\">still</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"4\">logistic</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"5\">regression;</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"6\">only</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"8\">features</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"9\">changed.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مرزهای مستقیم محدودیت نیستند. اگر به مدل ویژگی‌های به توان دو بدهی، مثل <code>x1</code> به توان دو و <code>x2</code> به توان دو (فصل 8)، آن‌وقت با وزن‌های 1 و 1 و <code>b = -1</code> مرز <code>x1² + x2² = 1</code> یک دایره است: نقطه‌های داخل دسته‌ی 0 و نقطه‌های بیرون دسته‌ی 1. مدل هنوز رگرسیون لجستیک است؛ فقط ویژگی‌ها عوض شده‌اند.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-94-odds-and-log-odds\"><span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"0\">9.4</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"1\">Odds</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"2\">and</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"3\">log-odds</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">9.4 شانس و لگاریتم شانس</div>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"0\">Beyond</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"2\">videos</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"3\">(this</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"6\">statistician's</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"7\">view,</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"8\">as</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"9\">in</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"10\">StatQuest).</span></em> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <strong><span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"1\">odds</span></strong> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"3\">an</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"4\">event</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"5\">are</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"6\">p</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"7\">divided</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"8\">by</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"9\">(1</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"10\">-</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"11\">p):</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"12\">a</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"13\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"14\">of</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"15\">0.8</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"16\">is</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"17\">odds</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"18\">of</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"19\">4</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"20\">to</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"21\">1.</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"1\">logarithm</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"4\">odds</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <strong><span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"7\">log-odds</span></strong> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"8\">(or</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"9\">logit):</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"10\">ln</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"11\">4</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"12\">=</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"13\">1.386.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>بیرون از ویدیوها</strong> (این دید آماردان است، مثل StatQuest). <strong>شانس (odds)</strong> یک رویداد <code>p</code> تقسیم بر <code>(1 - p)</code> است: احتمال 0.8 یعنی شانس 4 به 1. لگاریتم شانس <strong>لگاریتم‌شانس (log-odds، یا logit)</strong> است: <code>ln 4 = 1.386</code>.</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"0\">Here</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"3\">neat</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"4\">fact:</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"5\">z</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"6\">=</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"7\">w</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"8\">.</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"9\">x</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"10\">+</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"11\">b</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"12\">is</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"13\">exactly</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"15\">log-odds.</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"0\">Logistic</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"1\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"3\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"4\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"5\">on</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"7\">log-odds,</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"10\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"11\">just</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"12\">turns</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"13\">log-odds</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"14\">back</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"15\">into</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"17\">probability.</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"0\">This</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"1\">gives</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"2\">you</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"4\">way</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"5\">to</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"6\">read</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"8\">weights:</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"9\">each</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"10\">increase</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"11\">of</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"12\">1</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"13\">in</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"14\">feature</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"15\">j</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"16\">multiplies</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"17\">the</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"18\">odds</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"19\">by</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"20\">e</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"21\">to</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"22\">the</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"23\">power</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"24\">w_j.</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"1\">weight</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"3\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"4\">multiplies</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"6\">odds</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"7\">by</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"8\">1.649,</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"9\">so</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"10\">\"4</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"11\">to</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"12\">1\"</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"13\">becomes</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"14\">about</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"15\">\"6.6</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"16\">to</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"17\">1\",</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"18\">all</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"19\">else</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"20\">equal.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">نکته‌ی جالب این است: <code>z = w . x + b</code> دقیقاً همان لگاریتم‌شانس است. رگرسیون لجستیک رگرسیون خطی روی لگاریتم‌شانس است و سیگموید فقط لگاریتم‌شانس را دوباره به احتمال تبدیل می‌کند. این راهی برای خواندن وزن‌ها می‌دهد: هر افزایش 1 در ویژگی <code>j</code> شانس را در <code>e</code> به توان <code>w_j</code> ضرب می‌کند. وزن 0.5 شانس را در 1.649 ضرب می‌کند، پس «4 به 1» با ثابت بودن بقیه به حدود «6.6 به 1» تبدیل می‌شود.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-95-the-threshold-is-a-choice\"><span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"0\">9.5</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"1\">The</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"2\">threshold</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"5\">choice</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">9.5 آستانه یک انتخاب است</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"1\">default</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"2\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"3\">treats</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"4\">both</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"5\">mistakes</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"6\">as</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"7\">equally</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"8\">bad.</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"0\">In</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"1\">lending</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"2\">they</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"3\">are</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"4\">not.</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"0\">Approving</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"2\">loan</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"3\">that</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"4\">defaults</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"5\">costs</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"6\">far</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"7\">more</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"8\">than</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"9\">declining</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"11\">good</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"12\">applicant.</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"1\">can</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"2\">lower</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"4\">threshold</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"5\">to</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"6\">flag</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"7\">more</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"8\">risky</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"9\">cases</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"10\">(catching</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"11\">more</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"12\">bad</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"13\">loans,</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"14\">with</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"15\">more</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"16\">false</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"17\">alarms)</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"18\">or</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"19\">raise</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"20\">it</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"21\">to</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"22\">be</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"23\">stricter.</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"0\">Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"1\">12</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"2\">shows</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"3\">how</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"4\">to</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"5\">choose</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"6\">with</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"7\">numbers.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">پیش‌فرض 0.5 هر دو اشتباه را به یک اندازه بد می‌داند. در وام‌دهی این‌طور نیست. تأیید وامی که نکول می‌کند خیلی گران‌تر از رد متقاضی خوب است. می‌توانی آستانه را پایین بیاوری تا موارد پرریسک بیشتری علامت بخورند (وام بد بیشتری گرفته می‌شود، با هشدار کاذب بیشتر) یا بالا ببری تا سخت‌گیرتر باشد. فصل 12 نشان می‌دهد چطور با عدد انتخاب کنی.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-96-more-than-two-classes\"><span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"0\">9.6</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"1\">More</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"2\">than</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"3\">two</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"4\">classes</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">9.6 بیش از دو دسته</div>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"0\">Beyond</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"2\">videos.</span></em> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"0\">With</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"1\">more</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"2\">than</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"3\">two</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"4\">classes</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"5\">(the</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"6\">Gmail</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"7\">tabs</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"8\">example)</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"10\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"11\">is</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"12\">replaced</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"13\">by</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <strong><span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"15\">softmax</span></strong> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"16\">function.</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"1\">turns</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"2\">one</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"3\">score</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"4\">per</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"5\">class</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"6\">into</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"7\">probabilities</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"8\">that</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"9\">add</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"10\">up</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"11\">to</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"12\">1.</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"1\">will</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"2\">meet</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"3\">it</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"4\">again</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"5\">as</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"7\">last</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"8\">layer</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"9\">of</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"10\">most</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"11\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"12\">networks.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>بیرون از ویدیوها.</strong> با بیش از دو دسته (مثال تب‌های Gmail) سیگموید با تابع <strong>softmax</strong> جایگزین می‌شود. یک امتیاز برای هر دسته را به احتمال‌هایی تبدیل می‌کند که جمعشان 1 است. دوباره به‌عنوان لایه‌ی آخر بیشتر شبکه‌های عصبی با آن برخورد می‌کنی.</div>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef sigmoid(z):\n    return 1 / (1 + np.exp(-z))\n\nprint(sigmoid(np.array([-3, -1, 0, 1, 3])).round(3))      # [0.047 0.269 0.5   0.731 0.953]\n\nw, b = np.array([1.0, 1.0]), -3.0\nfor x in ([1, 1], [2, 2], [3, 0]):\n    p = sigmoid(np.dot(w, x) + b)\n    print(x, round(p, 3), \"-&gt;\", int(p &gt;= 0.5))\n# [1, 1] 0.269 -&gt; 0\n# [2, 2] 0.731 -&gt; 1\n# [3, 0] 0.5 -&gt; 1   (exactly on the boundary: the &gt;= rule says 1)\n\np = 0.8\nprint(round(p / (1 - p), 2), round(np.log(p / (1 - p)), 3))   # 4.0 1.386  odds and log-odds\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"0\">Loan</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"1\">example.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"1\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"3\">an</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"4\">offer</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"6\">accepted</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"9\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"10\">of</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"11\">w1</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"12\">x</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"13\">amount</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"14\">+</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"15\">w2</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"16\">x</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"17\">terms</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"18\">+</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"19\">w3</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"20\">x</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"21\">credit</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"22\">score</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"23\">+</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"24\">b.</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"25\">A</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"26\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"27\">of</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"28\">0.83</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"29\">means</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"30\">\"about</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"31\">83</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"32\">of</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"33\">100</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"34\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"35\">like</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"36\">this</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"37\">are</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"38\">accepted\".</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"1\">can</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"2\">rank</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"3\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"4\">by</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"5\">it,</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"6\">or</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"7\">turn</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"8\">it</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"9\">into</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"11\">decision</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"12\">with</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"13\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"14\">threshold,</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"15\">and</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"17\">customer-facing</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"18\">explanation</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"19\">can</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"20\">use</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"21\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"22\">weights:</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"23\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"24\">larger</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"25\">amount</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"26\">lowers</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"27\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"28\">odds</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"29\">of</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"30\">acceptance</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"31\">by</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"32\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"33\">certain</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"34\">factor.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>مثال وام.</strong> احتمال پذیرش یک پیشنهاد سیگموید <code>w1 x amount + w2 x terms + w3 x credit score + b</code> است. احتمال 0.83 یعنی «حدود 83 از 100 پیشنهاد مثل این پذیرفته می‌شوند». می‌توانی پیشنهادها را با آن رتبه‌بندی کنی، یا با یک آستانه به تصمیم تبدیلش کنی، و یک توضیح برای مشتری می‌تواند از وزن‌ها استفاده کند: مبلغ بزرگ‌تر شانس پذیرش را با یک ضریب مشخص کم می‌کند.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"0\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"1\">mistakes</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>اشتباه‌های رایج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"0\">Using</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"1\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"2\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"3\">on</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"5\">0</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"6\">or</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"7\">1</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"8\">target.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">استفاده از رگرسیون خطی روی هدف 0 یا 1.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"0\">Thinking</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"2\">model</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"3\">output</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"6\">certainty.</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"3\">probability,</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"5\">only</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"6\">as</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"7\">good</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"8\">as</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"9\">its</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"10\">calibration</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"11\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"12\">12).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">فکر کردن اینکه خروجی مدل یک قطعیت است. یک احتمال است، و فقط به اندازه‌ی کالیبراسیونش خوب است (فصل 12).</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"0\">Treating</span> <span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"1\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"2\">as</span> <span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"3\">sacred.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدس دانستن 0.5.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"0\">Forgetting</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"1\">to</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"2\">scale</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"4\">features</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"5\">before</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"6\">training</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"7\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"8\">8).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">فراموش کردن مقیاس‌دهی ویژگی‌ها پیش از آموزش (فصل 8).</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Check yourself</strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>خودت را بسنج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Compute sigmoid(0) and say what it means.<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><code>sigmoid(0)</code> را حساب کن و بگو چه معنایی دارد.</div></li>\n<li>For w = [2, -1], b = 1 and x = [1, 3], what is z, and what does the model predict?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">برای <code>w = [2, -1]</code> و <code>b = 1</code> و <code>x = [1, 3]</code> مقدار <code>z</code> چیست و مدل چه پیش‌بینی می‌کند؟</div></li>\n<li>Why can a straight line not be the model for yes or no data?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">چرا یک خط راست نمی‌تواند مدل داده‌های بله/خیر باشد؟</div></li>\n<li>A probability is 0.2. What are the odds?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">احتمال 0.2 است. شانس (odds) چیست؟</div></li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"answers\"><summary>Show answers</summary><p> (1) 0.5: the model is undecided, and the input is on the decision boundary. (2) z = 2 x 1 - 1 x 3 + 1 = 0, so the probability is 0.5, exactly on the boundary. (3) It gives values outside 0 and 1, and a single outlier can move its threshold. (4) 0.2 / 0.8 = 0.25, which is 1 to 4.</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><em>پاسخ‌ها.</em> (1) 0.5: مدل مردد است و ورودی روی مرز تصمیم قرار دارد. (2) <code>z = 2 x 1 - 1 x 3 + 1 = 0</code>، پس احتمال 0.5 است، دقیقاً روی مرز. (3) مقدارهایی بیرون از 0 و 1 می‌دهد و یک داده‌ی پرت می‌تواند آستانه‌اش را جابه‌جا کند. (4) <code>0.2 / 0.8 = 0.25</code>، یعنی 1 به 4.</div></details>\n<p><strong>Go deeper:</strong> Ng, course 1, videos 31 to 33 · StatQuest, <a class=\"vlink\" href=\"#/watch/yIYKR4sgzI8\">Logistic Regression</a> (9 minutes) and, for log-odds, <a class=\"vlink\" href=\"#/watch/ARfXDSkQf1Y\">Odds and Log(Odds), Clearly Explained</a> · the scikit-learn <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html#logistic-regression\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">logistic regression section</a>.</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>برای مطالعه‌ی بیشتر:</strong> Ng، درس 1، ویدیوهای 31 تا 33 · StatQuest، Logistic Regression (9 دقیقه) و برای لگاریتم‌شانس، Odds and Log(Odds), Clearly Explained · بخش رگرسیون لجستیک scikit-learn.</div>\n"}